  "text": "Recipe: Air Fried Patties\nCreator: Mrs N K Manku\nCategory: Patties\nIngredients: ragi (finger millet) flour, jowar (sorghum) flour, oats, beans, spinach, amaranth leaves, mint, coriander, onion, carrots, beetroot, flaxseed powder, chia seed powder, sesame seeds, pumpkin seeds, watermelon seeds, dates, berries, potatoes, crushed garlic, black pepper, cumin seeds, saunf (fennel seeds), elaichi powder (cardamom powder), lemon juice\nCooking methods: air-fry, no-cook\nInstructions: DOUGH: Made from 1:1:1 ratio of ragi (finger millet) flour, jowar (sorghum) flour & oats. Mix in some potatoes, onion, beans, carrots, beetroot, spinach, amaranth leaves, crushed garlic, black pepper, cumin seeds, saunf (fennel seeds), elaichi powder (cardamom powder), sesame seeds, 2 tbsp flaxseed powder, 2 tsp chia seed powder, 2 tsp lemon juice. PATTIES: Make balls using dough. Air fry for 15 minutes each side. Garnish with pumpkin seeds or watermelon seeds & mint. Serve with coriander chutney and dates-n-berries paste.\nNotes: A recipe with WHOLE GRAINS (ragi flour, jowar flour, oats), TUBERS (potatoes), RAINBOW VEGGIES (onion, carrots, beetroot), LEAFY GREENS (spinach, amaranth greens), SEEDS (flaxseed powder, chia seed powder, sesame seeds), HERBS & SPICES (crushed garlic, black pepper, cumin seeds, fennel seeds, lemon juice). Accompaniments: coriander chutney, dates-n-berries paste.",
